Lemma "user/R3.threshold (2D core): a damping floor below which the certified level is nonpositive".
"  ==>  \forall c0 (\forall k (\forall zeta ((((k) > ((0)))&(((c0)+((k)*(zeta))) <= ((0))))->(((k)*(zeta)) <= (-(c0))))))
